## smart-ia-mvp — .gitignore unificado
## Baseado no template oficial do .NET (dotnet new gitignore)
## Cobertura: todos os projetos em src/ e tests/

## ---------- Secrets ----------
appsettings.json
appsettings.*.Local.json
*.env
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
api-srv.csproj.lscache

## ---------- Build results ----------
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Bb]uild/
[Bb]uild[Ll]og.*
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/
[Pp]ublish/
publishprofiles/

## Visual Studio cache/options directory
.vs/

## Rider
.idea/

## ---------- User-specific files ----------
*.rsuser
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.userprefs

## Mono auto generated files
mono_crash.*

## ---------- NuGet ----------
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
**/[Pp]ackages/*
!**/[Pp]ackages/build/
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
artifacts/

## nDroid — some MSBuild binaries
## (n/a, kept minimal)

## ---------- Test / coverage ----------
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
[Bb]uild[Ll]og.*
[Cc]overage/
[Cc]overage.xml
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
TestResult.xml
nunit-*.xml
*.trx

## Code coverage tools
*.pdb.md5

## ---------- Static web assets / Razor ----------
_project.Razor.Components.Import/
_app.scvswa.dswa.cache.json
*.dswa.cache.json
rjsmcshtml.dswa.cache.json

## ---------- ASP.NET generated ----------
**/Properties/launchSettings.json.tmp

## ---------- Others ----------
## Publish profiles are shared, but secrets in publish profiles
*.pubxml.user

## JetBrains Rider per-user files
.idea/**/workspace.xml
.idea/**/tasks.xml
.idea/**/usage.statistics.xml
.idea/**/shelf/

## VS Code
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json

## Windows
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

## macOS
.DS_Store
._*

